<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Canberra backs reasonable pay rise in wage claim case.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Canberra backs reasonable pay rise in wage claim case.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Industrial Relations Minister Peter Reith said on Friday the government would be supporting a reasonable pay rise in its submission to the upcoming living wage case.</p>
<p>&quot;The government will be supporting a reasonable wage rise in the case, but one targetted at those who most need it - the lower paid,&quot; Reith told an industrial relations conference.</p>
</text>
